&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Serverless&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[tracing] Create and reparent span for Azure API Management (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3617973130" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7806" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7806/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7806"&gt;#7806&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
